{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他暂且不替喜欢安排去向，只让眼前的亲近自然发生。\",\n      \"key\": \"安排去向\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不要求对方回应，也不总查看对方的反应，便能安心靠近、自在地关心对方，还挺满意自己能不计较。\",\n      \"key\": \"安心靠近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"那时他真觉得，能这样安静地亲近对方，眼下已经够了。\",\n      \"key\": \"已经够了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"相处得这样舒服，他已盼着这一刻慢一点过去，可时间仍在往前走。\",\n      \"key\": \"慢一点过去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"text\": \"偶尔他想多给一点，热情刚涌上来，又因还不敢把心意全交出去而慢慢收住。\",\n      \"key\": \"慢慢收住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留暂缓安排去向、让眼前亲近自然发生的选择。不再把说不清怕什么当成固定前提，因为S01-2已具体写出他怕心意露得太明白会改变关系；暂缓规划与害怕暴露心意分别由S02-1和S02-5承接。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\", \"R8\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"将不要求回应、不总查看反应、安心靠近和自在关心合成一条，并用挺满意自己能不计较保留R8的自我满意，为后来因仍盼回应而难堪留下前因。S02-2不接在S02-1之后，因为暂缓安排未来并不能自动推出不期待回应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\", \"S02-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-3保留他当时真觉得眼前的亲近已经够了，为S03后来发现期待仍会增长留下必要前提。S02-4补上相处越舒服越舍不得这一刻、却知道时间仍在走的感受，解释B2和B4，不把满足写成全无惆怅。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足\",\n      \"why\": \"原线只写温柔逐渐展开，没有交代热情为何短暂涌起又收回。保留这层收放，并通过S01-2的跨段箭头说明，限制他的不是亲近本身，而是怕心意显露得太明白会改变关系。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ee12cea5-a91f-4b69-bcca-8ecb9884e19a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T144357650092Z", "elapsed_seconds": 1233.453, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T15:04:31.118212+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e5e7d6a1586729248f5c1675d79fb4bb4ba4991314ada0a28fd0e6ad2b53b8df", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T144357650092Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8268a98d8717868fd26